208
00:21:21,320 --> 00:21:27,870
one is you and the other is this young man.”
Although Tesla fundamentally disagreed with

209
00:21:27,870 --> 00:21:34,380
the notion of direct-current, he was put to
work improving the DC motors devised by Edison,

210
00:21:34,380 --> 00:21:40,460
who believed that the AC devices that Tesla
envisioned were too dangerous and unfeasible,

211
00:21:40,460 --> 00:21:45,870
a divergence of opinion that would become
a lifelong rivalry. Forced to develop an invention

212
00:21:45,870 --> 00:21:52,760
he had no belief in, Tesla became disillusioned
and began outlining the weaknesses of DC and

213
00:21:52,760 --> 00:21:58,250
championing the advantages of AC, pointing
