220
00:22:34,070 --> 00:22:39,510
50 to 60 times per second, was a lot more
effective, since it could flexibly sustain

221
00:22:39,510 --> 00:22:45,940
varying levels of high voltage power and minimize
power loss over long distances. This is why

222
00:22:45,940 --> 00:22:51,919
today, the power delivered to consumers via
power grids is AC, which sustains power over

223
00:22:51,919 --> 00:22:59,110
long distances using transformer substations,
these reduce the AC voltage over a given distance.

224
00:22:59,110 --> 00:23:05,060
Once the AC power reaches its destination
such as a home, the AC power is used directly

225
00:23:05,060 --> 00:23:10,400
