237
00:24:15,520 --> 00:24:21,020
Having learned from his mistakes, in 1886,
with the aid of philanthropists Alfred S.

238
00:24:21,020 --> 00:24:27,650
Brown, a Western Union superintendent, and
Charles F. Peck, Tesla established another

239
00:24:27,650 --> 00:24:33,360
company, this time called the Tesla Electric
Company based in Manhattan, New York, where

240
00:24:33,360 --> 00:24:39,409
he finalized the designs of the polyphase
