262
00:26:44,679 --> 00:26:50,510
With Edison sidelined, the alternating current
emerged as the undisputed victor of ‘War

263
00:26:50,510 --> 00:26:56,550
of the Currents’ as Westinghouse increased
his annual turnover from 800,000 dollars in

264
00:26:56,550 --> 00:27:06,140
1887 to 4.2 million in 1890, while Tesla was
