while next noticing that when his experimental

320
00:32:42,510 --> 00:32:48,269
Tesla coil was powered, it emitted sparks
as far as 30 feet that could be detected by

321
00:32:48,269 --> 00:32:54,120
antennae 10 miles away. Realizing that he
could now wirelessly transmit signals using

322
00:32:54,120 --> 00:33:00,309
the electromagnetic frequencies of the planet,
Tesla explored the practical applications,

323
00:33:00,309 --> 00:33:07,330
managing to light up 200 lamps fed by a power
